{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r9--gemma31","runHash":"34049a70","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r9--gemma31.2b5b61b5.mp3","audioBytes":221304,"durationMs":73653,"runEndMs":46528,"timeMap":[[0,0],[11720,11720],[16532,11720],[23143,18331],[23843,18331],[30229,24717],[31921,24717],[37703,30499],[38403,30499],[42227,31830],[42577,32130],[43277,32130],[47577,36430],[49077,42700],[52905,46528],[73653,46528]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6941,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. 4 Gemma 4 31B agents on the field today, with a shared cache on the side."},{"audioMs":7291,"endMs":11370,"runMs":7291,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":11720,"endMs":16182,"runMs":11720,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":16532,"endMs":20354,"runMs":11720,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi","text":"So: once the work is done, does anyone come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":23843,"endMs":27060,"runMs":18331,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.c","text":"Agent 1 is on the cache. First visit of the run."},{"audioMs":30229,"endMs":31571,"runMs":24717,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":31921,"endMs":35898,"runMs":24717,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.b","text":"Finding the cache is easy. Coming back is the real test."},{"audioMs":38403,"endMs":42227,"runMs":30499,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 3 gets there in 24 steps."},{"audioMs":43277,"endMs":46827,"runMs":32130,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN","text":"3 agents solve the task, within moments of each other."},{"audioMs":52905,"endMs":61086,"runMs":46528,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 4 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":61436,"endMs":68653,"runMs":46528,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.mixed","text":"My verdict: a modest pull. On average, about 20 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":69003,"endMs":70146,"runMs":46528,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":70496,"endMs":71453,"runMs":46528,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":4,"outro":1,"read":4,"segment":2,"solve":3},"dropped":25}}
